  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Basic Infrastructure in Meheba and Mayukwayukwa, Resettlement Schemes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will address the critical development challenges in the resettlement schemes of Meheba and Mayukwayukwa, Zambia. These areas face inadequate infrastructure, limited access to social services, and socio-economic vulnerabilities, exacerbated by climate change and resource constraints. The project aims to enhance sustainable resettlement through infrastructure development, resilience building, and social cohesion. It seeks to improve livelihoods, provide dignified living conditions, and</narrative>
  </description>
